cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or data, please cite it using the metadata below.
  If you are citing the findings rather than the artefact, please cite the
  accompanying manuscript; contact the author for its current status.
type: software
title: >-
  Cross-platform cache, power and endurance measurement for battery-powered
  edge inference nodes
abstract: >-
  Measurement harness, raw hardware performance-counter and battery-rail power
  logs, analysis scripts and a verification script for a study of on-node
  neural inference running from a battery on two Arm platforms. Covers latency
  prediction from cache traffic, parallel-scaling behaviour and its reversal
  between microarchitectures, reduced-precision compression, and battery-rail
  power and thermal measurement.
